      "start_seconds": 1.11,
      "end_seconds": 3.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "hello. Right, let's get started"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 5.09,
      "end_seconds": 10.33,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Right, hello, doctor, I came in with them, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.91,
      "end_seconds": 15.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "tell me from the beginning, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.19,
      "end_seconds": 22.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.17,
      "text": "She's been having puffiness around the eyes in the morning, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.06,
      "end_seconds": 27.1,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Let's go through your medication. What are you taking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 29.05,
      "end_seconds": 36.1,
      "duration_seconds": 7.05,
      "text": "She is on diclofenac, 50 milligrams, when I get pain, I give it to her."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.79,
      "end_seconds": 49.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "and how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.48,
      "end_seconds": 58.87,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "I'd say mild. I've also had foamy urine, for nearly five years. Oh, and tiredness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.33,
      "end_seconds": 64.56,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Any chest pain, blood in the urine, fever or breathlessness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.02,
      "end_seconds": 72.05,
      "duration_seconds": 6.03,
      "text": "No, no chest pain, blood in the urine, fever or breathlessness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.68,
      "end_seconds": 75.66,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "What about reduced urine output?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.1,
      "end_seconds": 80.82,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any reduced urine output."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.51,
      "end_seconds": 86.39,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Anything on the skin I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 89.95,
      "end_seconds": 91.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Skin's normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 91.76,
      "end_seconds": 96.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.17,
      "end_seconds": 105.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.68,
      "text": "Yeah, years back I got a rash from aspirin, so I stay away from it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 110.88,
      "end_seconds": 112.67,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "Okay, any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 114.39,
      "end_seconds": 118.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "I had a knee arthroscopy three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 119.94,
      "end_seconds": 121.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.38,
      "text": "How's your diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 124.26,
      "end_seconds": 125.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "I'm mostly vegetarian"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 127.55,
      "end_seconds": 130.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Are you working at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.83,
      "end_seconds": 135.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.58,
      "text": "Yes, I'm a nurse on a busy ward."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 136.36,
      "end_seconds": 140.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.84,
      "end_seconds": 142.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Yes, kidney disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.05,
      "end_seconds": 143.75,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.84,
      "end_seconds": 160.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.94,
      "text": "Let's get your blood pressure and the other basics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.17,
      "end_seconds": 174.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.24,
      "text": "Okay, give me a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.85,
      "end_seconds": 203.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "Okay: oxygen saturation is 98 percent, heart rate 84, pressure 154 over 93, temperature is 36.7 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.32,
      "end_seconds": 207.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.34,
      "text": "Let's do the physical part now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 221.61,
      "end_seconds": 222.31,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.25,
      "end_seconds": 227.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.42,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.02,
      "end_seconds": 250.2,
      "duration_seconds": 7.18,
      "text": "There's pitting swelling at both ankles, and your blood pressure is on the high side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.97,
      "end_seconds": 271.42,
      "duration_seconds": 16.45,
      "text": "Right, you can sit back down. So, based on the history and the examination, I'd lean towards progression of the kidney problem. A medication effect on the kidneys is also on my list."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.83,
      "end_seconds": 277.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.57,
      "text": "yeah, what are the chances it's something bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.93,
      "end_seconds": 306.84,
      "duration_seconds": 28.91,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now progression of the kidney problem is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's get kidney function tests, for chronic kidney disease. Let's get a urine protein test, for chronic kidney disease. Stay off anti-inflammatory painkillers like diclofenac or ibuprofen, they're hard on the kidneys. Keep an eye on salt and protein portions, a dietitian can help with the specifics."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.43,
      "end_seconds": 325.53,
      "duration_seconds": 18.1,
      "text": "don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day i'm going to send a referral to a kidney specialist please don't wait if the symptoms get worse that's when to be seen urgently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 330.75,
      "end_seconds": 333.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "right, you know, will do"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.6,
      "end_seconds": 339.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "I'd like you back after the results are back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.46,
      "end_seconds": 344.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "Yes, I can do that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 345.38,
      "end_seconds": 347.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "Alright, I'll see you out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.22,
      "end_seconds": 352.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "Alright, thanks. Bye for now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.13,
      "end_seconds": 354.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
